// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Ice_Mistral 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 32 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Ice Mistral 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P743416604" "Ice Mistral"
// ProfessionString :
"P1570498330" "Scirocco's Apprentice"
// DescriptionString :
"P528194374" "Irena Rudenko was chosen by one of the Monks of the Four Winds to become the Ice Mistral. Receiving the power changed her; she retained the icy-cold aloofness and desire for mastery of the wind, but none of the control. Her own rage overrode the honor normally imbued to the Knights of the Wind and she went on a mad killing spree. Scirocco took her under his wing to protect her from the Monks, many of which have fallen trying to reclaim their lost power. "
// WrongAllianceString :
"P2369373866" "My tasks are not for the likes of you, {HeroName}. Find someone else to pester."
// TaskForceInvite :
"P2528683177" "So you're here. Looking for favor from my master, Scirocco, I suppose. Well, I suspect it'll be easy to earn. All he wants is a crystal, one belonging to the genie, Serafina. It's currently being held by the Circle of Thorns.<A HREF={ACCEPT}> Bring that crystal here, and Scirocco will smile on you.</A>"
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P2150639211" "You think you will be of use to Scirocco? You are far too inexperienced. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 35. If they are over Level 40, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 40 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P3498089419" "You would serve Arachnos better by seeking greater challenges. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 35. If they are over Level 40, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 40 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P2722898085" "This is a challenging task. You'll need at least three other people to help you. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 35. If they are over Level 40, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 40 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P3814998213" "I need to speak to your team leader. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 35. If they are over Level 40, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 40 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P1313970443" "Bring your team leader to me at once. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 35. If they are over Level 40, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 40 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// BadTeamLevel :
"P3498556534" "I don't like to repeat myself. Get everyone here, and then we'll talk. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 35. If they are over Level 40, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 40 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// TaskForceName :
"P3509438718" "Strike Force Squall"
// TaskForceName :
"P4034167471" "Strike Force Tempest"
// TaskForceName :
"P1552790484" "Strike Force Wild"
// TaskForceName :
"P1112287228" "Strike Force Windswept"
// HelloString :
"P571248952" "Welcome, {TaskForceName}."
// HelloString :
"P2268196013" "We have much to do."
// HelloString :
"P53802055" "There is more work ahead."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2737195464" "We haven't met. Perhaps you should see {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4173911021" "You'll need a name, something I can call you by. Perhaps {TaskForceName}."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2276618760" "There's nothing more we can do together. Seek other challenges."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3683801856" "You're getting good. I'll have more instructions for you shortly. You can call me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2622806068" "You are doing quite well. I'm sure Scirocco will be pleased."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1575652833" "You've got other challenges to face."
// LocationString :
"P3437209096" "St. Martial"
// IntroString :
"P856364347" ""
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


