// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Ractespriel 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 32 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Ractespriel 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1339051655" "Ractespriel"
// ProfessionString :
"P513001296" "Vengeful Demon"
// DescriptionString :
"P594574097" "A Prince of the Netherworld, Ractespriel quickly grew angry at being summoned and bound to the will of the sorcerers of the Circle of Thorns. He chaffed at such servitude, but bided his time, assouging his injured pride with the sacrifices for his service. Events came to a head when heroes robbed him of his due sacrifice, and the Circle's wizards refused to offer a replacement. Through means unknown, he led several other dissasstified demons to the mortal world, and there they offered their services to Arachnos. Their motives were simple: Revenge against the Circle of Thorns. Under the wary watch of the Mu Mystics of Arachnos, Tresparciel shares her knowledge of the mystic nexus called the Thorn Tree to villains willing to attack it and steal it's power from the Circle of Thorns to re-make themselves."
// WrongAllianceString :
// TaskForceInvite :
"P1175081439" "Such is my hatred for the Circle of Thorns, that I shall tell you of a way to do them great harm. I shall tell you of a place where the Circle of Thorns channels the mystic energy they steal from the ruins of Mu. It is called the Thorn Tree. If you have heard of it before, you know that it offers the chance to re-make yourself. That is, if you have the power and the will to steal its energy for yourself. The Circle is about to start chanelling energy through the tree again, and I know the time to strike. But before I tell you where to find this place, I need to know if you can accomplish the task I will set before you. Defeat 50 members of the Circle of Thorns, and return to me when you are done."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P2856700074" "Vile worm! That a mortal such as you would even appear before me is an insult. I have no use for you, unless you have a threat level of at least 44. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 44.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P3307014574" "You should never see this, as this is my reply if you are too high level! Strange, is it not?"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P1451163590" "As a demon, I know the importance of numerology in all things. I refuse to assist you unless can bring before me a group of at least 4 rogues. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 44.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P1037913633" "DO NOT INSULT ME! I speak only to your team's leader! <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 44.</color>"
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P1996872799" "All of your group must be present. Bring them here, that I may see the instruments of my vengance. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 44.</color>"
// BadTeamLevel :
"P1887818765" "There is a weakness on your team. At least one in your group is unworthy and does not have a threat level sufficient to my needs. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 44.</color>"
// TaskForceName :
"P1744696745" "Revenance"
// TaskForceName :
"P1857735518" "Spite"
// TaskForceName :
"P1403108352" "Revenge"
// TaskForceName :
"P2777873342" "Malice"
// HelloString :
"P43328989" "What is it, worm?"
// HelloString :
"P2758484351" "Why are you bothering me?"
// HelloString :
"P1002136545" "What do you want, pathetic wretch?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3691403937" "I do not care to speak to you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4097354676" "That I, a Prince of the Netherworld, am reduced to this? Tragedy. Still, I think you will be able to carry out this task. So that I do not sully my tongue with your names, I will simply call you {TaskForceName}, should I need to call you anything at all."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3460799438" "You should never see this text. It is curious that you do."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3970044569" "The Circle and their minions are in agony. Excellent."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P579626114" "Strike down the foe without mercy or remorse!"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3677383147" "This, too, is text that should be unseen by all mortal eyes."
// LocationString :
"P2093761884" "Nerva Archipelago"
// IntroString :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


