// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Silver_Mantis 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 32 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Silver Mantis 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2060199557" "Silver Mantis"
// ProfessionString :
"P4095589428" "Black Scorpion's Psychotic Henchwoman"
// DescriptionString :
"P1255659319" "Tamura Shirai is fascinated with the smooth, sleek feel of metal. Funding the augmentation of her body to pure metal was an expensive proposition, however, so she turned to crime. During one of her robberies she encountered Black Scorpion, on a job for Lord Recluse. Tamura realized an opportunity when she saw it, and rather than fighting with Arachnos over the ill-gotten loot, formed an alliance that has lasted to this day."
// WrongAllianceString :
// TaskForceInvite :
"P3599831885" "Colonel Virgil Duray, the leader of those pathetic paramilitary renegades known as the Sky Raiders, has hatched a plan to vault his little band of mercenary misfits to the top again. They plan to plunder enhancement technologies, drugs, and even some minor magics from every group they can. They just made one mistake: They didn't clear this desperate little power-grab with Arachnos. So now they have to fail. <br><br>Lord Recluse has asked Black Scorpion to handle it, and he's authorized me to create a task force of whomever I see fit. So I'm looking for mercenaries, killers, madmen, and murderers who can get the job done and crush the Colonel Duray's little plan."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P706659105" "You shouldn't waste my time, you worthless piece of trash. You're so weak I wouldn't even enjoy killing you. Come back when you're at least Threat Level 20, and maybe then you can come out and play. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 20. If they are over Level 25, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 25 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P2180791057" "So, you're gaining recognition, earning a high Threat Level? Should I be impressed? Too bad. You've overdone it. Your Threat Level is over 25 now, and that puts you outside the range for this operation, and off the list. Well, I'm sure you can find something else to do. <br><br>It's too bad, really. I wanted to watch the way you destroy. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 20. If they are over Level 25, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 25 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P3337511650" "Send your team's leader to me. Unless they're afraid. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 20. If they are over Level 25, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 25 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P678395099" "You need to get at least a team of 4 for this. Much as I like watching weaklings die, this needs to have at least a chance of success, or Black Scorpion will get mad that I sent you to your death. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 20. If they are over Level 25, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 25 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P4249637164" "Get everyone in your little team together, and bring them to me. I want to see what kind of killers you are. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 20. If they are over Level 25, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 25 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// BadTeamLevel :
"P2143913907" "Someone on your team isn't Threat Level 20. Their weakness is holding you back. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 20. If they are over Level 25, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 25 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// TaskForceName :
"P954212561" "Strike Force Buzzsaw"
// TaskForceName :
"P2176426895" "Strike Force Bonesaw"
// TaskForceName :
"P1698931588" "Strike Force Broadsword"
// TaskForceName :
"P1540857415" "Strike Force Chainsaw"
// TaskForceName :
"P677741927" "Strike Force Stilleto"
// TaskForceName :
"P3066356802" "Strike Force Scalpel"
// TaskForceName :
"P3458862913" "Strike Force Razorblade"
// HelloString :
"P3439349816" "Killed anyone lately?"
// HelloString :
"P3101273668" "Time to kill?"
// HelloString :
"P2567874884" "Ready for some bloodletting?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2342102824" "And you are? That's right. Not important enough to kill."
// FirstVisitString :
"P745353139" "I think I'm going to call you {TaskForceName}, after one of my favorite implements of mutilation. Do you like it?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1349232116" "We're done for now. There's a lot of clean-up still to do, and I can't wait to get out in the field."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P936568842" "Such style. Such power. Such bloodthirst. I'm impressed!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3373925226" "Black Scorpion told me he was impressed with you. I thought you might want to know."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3081471072" "You will never see this side of me."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3958075051" "string"
