// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Sparcetriel 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3983812844" "Sparcetriel"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P41131566" "A fiend of the netherworld, Sparcetriel had often been summoned and bound by the sorcerers of the Circle of Thorns to do their will. After tasting bitter defeat without reward once too often, Sparcetriel and several other demons found their way to the mortal world through unknown means, and offered their services to Arachnos. Their motives were simple: Revenge against the Circle of Thorns. Under the wary watch of the Mu Mystics of Arachnos, Sparcetriel shares his knowledge of the mystic nexus called the Thorn Tree to villains willing to attack it and steal it's power from the Circle of Thorns to re-make themselves."
// WrongAllianceString :
// TaskForceInvite :
"P441546917" "I will tell you of a place where the Circle of Thorns routes their mystic powers to create great and fell effects. Through brute force and evil will, you can steal this power from them, and use to re-forge yourself. But before I tell you where to find this place, you must first show me you have the might to succeed. Defeat 25 members of the Circle of Thorns, and return to me when you are done."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P1082789532" "You would have no use for the power I can deliver to you. Return when you are a threat of the 24th order or higher! <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 24. If they are over Level 33, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 33 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P2352043238" "Perhaps you would be better served by seeking Trepsarciel. She should be around this zone somewhere. Perhaps she can deliver you the powers you seek. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 24. If they are over Level 33, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 33 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P2172733731" "It will take at least 4 souls bound in wickedness to accomplish this task. Gather more to your group until you have at least 4 villains with you. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 24. If they are over Level 33, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 33 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P2871790266" "Bring forth the leader of your group, and we shall speak. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 24. If they are over Level 33, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 33 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P939582850" "Gather your group around you. All must be on this island. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 24. If they are over Level 33, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 33 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// BadTeamLevel :
"P2278628817" "One or more of you is not within the proper range of power. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 24. If they are over Level 33, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 33 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// TaskForceName :
"P2349868072" "Power Theives"
// HelloString :
"P887688606" "From the heart of Darkness, I greet you."
// HelloString :
"P3010986822" "Ill met with ill tidings."
// HelloString :
"P3003811180" "Do you seek power? I will show you."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1131956048" "You are unknown to me."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1708891074" "A motley rabble of villains. Still, there is potential. I will call your group the {TaskForceName} for now."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P329751461" "There is nothing else to be said. Seek out Trepsarciel. Perhaps she can offer guidance to you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P344550945" "You have hurt the Circle greatly. This pleases me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3414291777" "Yes! The Circle shall feel my wrath through your depridations!"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3800162984" "Speak with demoness Trepsarciel. She will be able to help you better than I."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


