// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Trepsarciel 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 32 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Trepsarciel 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1155113121" "Trepsarciel"
// ProfessionString :
"P4282821015" "Vengeful Demoness"
// DescriptionString :
"P275761286" "A succubus of the netherworld, Tresparciel was often summoned and bound by the sorcerers of the Circle of Thorns. She served them as loyally as a demon is able, until a self-rightous summoner denied her the proper rewards due her following a defeat at the hands of Paragon City's heroes. Angered, Tresparciel and several other demons found their way to the mortal world through unknown means, and offered their services to Arachnos. Their motives were simple: Revenge against the Circle of Thorns. Under the wary watch of the Mu Mystics of Arachnos, Tresparciel shares her knowledge of the mystic nexus called the Thorn Tree to villains willing to attack it and steal it's power from the Circle of Thorns to re-make themselves."
// WrongAllianceString :
// TaskForceInvite :
"P1519408909" "I learned many arcane things when I was summoned by the Circle of Thorns. Now they are going to regret betraying me. I'll tell you of a place where the Circle of Thorns channels the mystic energy they steal from the ruins of Mu. It's called the Thorn Tree. If you've heard of it before, you know that it offers the chance to re-make yourself, if you have the power and the will to steal it's energy for yourself. The Circle is about to start chanelling energy through the tree once more, and I know just the time to strike. But before I tell you where to find this place, I need to know if you have what it takes. Defeat 40 members of the Circle of Thorns, and return to me when you are done."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P980509637" "Your power waxes ever greater. See me again when you are a threat of at least level 34. We can talk then. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 34. If they are over Level 43, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 43 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P1713991815" "Ooooh, such power, such might. You're just too much for me! <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 34. If they are over Level 43, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 43 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P894635293" "This could get... Messy. You should bring along at least 3 more friends to make it worth my while, and all of you should be a threat level of 34 to 43. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 34. If they are over Level 43, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 43 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P3412332583" "Bring me the one in charge of your team. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 34. If they are over Level 43, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 43 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P898650490" "How can we get started if all of you aren't here? You all need to be in the same zone at least. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 34. If they are over Level 43, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 43 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// BadTeamLevel :
"P596810964" "I'm afraid some of your friends aren't quite my type. I think they're outside the power range I like to see. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 34. If they are over Level 43, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 43 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// TaskForceName :
"P2124736935" "Chrysalis"
// HelloString :
"P1137684553" "Well, hello there."
// HelloString :
"P1775096311" "I always have time for powerful people."
// HelloString :
"P3733521161" "My, my, my. And how are you?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P997063592" "I'm afraid we haven't been properly introduced."
// FirstVisitString :
"P34648748" "All new things require new names; even change itself. I think I'll call your little band {TaskForceName} for all the changes you're about to go through."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2196565403" "Oops. We're done."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3373785400" "You've hurt the Circle of Thorns so well. I like to see that."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2004979333" "The Circle are cursing your name. Maybe it's bad, but I find that exciting, don't you?"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1416172723" "Oopsie. I think we're done. Maybe you should find Ractespriel?"
