// Name :
"P4047320273" "Virgil Tarikoss"
// ProfessionString :
"P708718508" "Cagey Mystic"
// DescriptionString :
"P3511695224" "Virgil Tarikoss is a newcomer to the Rogue Isles, but has already made a name for himself. Tarikoss often plays other mystics against each other as he works towards his own secretive goals. Rumors have recently spread that Tarikoss is looking for villains to help him complete his master plan. Though no one knows what Tarikoss' final objectives are, all those in the know agree that whatever his plan is, it must be something big."
// WrongAllianceString :
// TaskForceInvite :
"P165658158" "If you have sought me, out then you must be ambitious. If you have found me, you must be wicked. These aspects combined make you perfect for the tasks I can place before you."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P1516528417" "I applaud your cruel ambition, but your powers are not sufficient for my needs. Return when you have achieved at least a threat level of 15. Then, you may be strong enough to survive. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 15. If they are over Level 20, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 20 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P495750475" "Your power exceeds my needs. Go, and find other things to occupy your wicked mind. "
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P2905281590" "You will need at least 4 fiends, madmen, and lawless rogues for this. Return when you have assembled them. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 15. If they are over Level 20, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 20 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P119875979" "Send your leader to me. I would speak with them about things dark and vile. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 15. If they are over Level 20, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 20 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P1711360733" "I do not see the number of rogues you claim to have. Bring them all of your group to the island. Then we can begin. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 15. If they are over Level 20, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 20 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// BadTeamLevel :
"P2834857081" "I fear that some within your group are not within the range of power I need. I'll leave it to you to fix. Return when you are between a threat level of 15 and 20. Then, you will be of use to me. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 15. If they are over Level 20, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 20 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// TaskForceName :
"P3485399595" "Strike Force Titan"
// TaskForceName :
